{
  "file": "common childhood",
  "page": 54,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        113.12979888916016,
        27.289522171020508,
        340.4130554199219,
        35.34652328491211
      ],
      "text": "RECOMMENDATIONS FOR MANAGEMENT OF COMMON CHILDHOOD CONDITIONS",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Ligh",
      "size": 7.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        60.173309326171875,
        376.4849548339844,
        73.36231231689453
      ],
      "text": "6.2\t Antibiotic treatment for non-severe pneumonia with no wheeze",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Bold",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        76.79890441894531,
        399.1128234863281,
        90.28890228271484
      ],
      "text": "a)\t Children with non-severe pneumonia (i.e. fast breathing with no chest indrawing",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        89.79890441894531,
        399.1114501953125,
        103.28890228271484
      ],
      "text": "or danger sign) should be treated with oral amoxicillin. The exception is in patients",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        102.79890441894531,
        108.49150085449219,
        116.28890228271484
      ],
      "text": "with HIV.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        115.79890441894531,
        399.0615234375,
        129.28890991210938
      ],
      "text": "—\t With low HIV prevalence, give amoxicillin of at least 40mg/kg/dose twice",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        82.20469665527344,
        128.7989044189453,
        148.3046875,
        142.28890991210938
      ],
      "text": "daily for 3 days.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        141.7989044189453,
        399.0715026855469,
        155.28890991210938
      ],
      "text": "—\t With high HIV prevalence, give amoxicillin of at least 40mg/kg/dose twice",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        82.20469665527344,
        154.7989044189453,
        146.03468322753906,
        168.28890991210938
      ],
      "text": "daily for 5 days.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        170.20358276367188,
        274.3729248046875,
        184.12359619140625
      ],
      "text": "(Weak recommendation, moderate quality evidence)",
      "font": "MinionPro-BoldIt",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        186.4682159423828,
        399.102783203125,
        199.95822143554688
      ],
      "text": "b)\tChildren with non-severe pneumonia who fail on the first line treatment with",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        199.4682159423828,
        399.1214904785156,
        212.95822143554688
      ],
      "text": "amoxicillin should have the option of referral where there is no appropriate second",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        212.4682159423828,
        127.7015151977539,
        225.95822143554688
      ],
      "text": "line treatment.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        227.87289428710938,
        225.62290954589844,
        241.79290771484375
      ],
      "text": "(Weak recommendation, expert opinion)",
      "font": "MinionPro-BoldIt",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        244.1374969482422,
        399.052978515625,
        257.62750244140625
      ],
      "text": "This recommendation was made based on mostly RCTs that were conducted in Asia,",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        257.1374816894531,
        399.0328674316406,
        270.62750244140625
      ],
      "text": "and more likely in low HIV prevalence settings. Amoxicillin was recommended",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        270.1374816894531,
        399.08282470703125,
        283.62750244140625
      ],
      "text": "based on values and preferences since dispersible amoxicillin is becoming more",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        283.1374816894531,
        399.11279296875,
        296.62750244140625
      ],
      "text": "available and the cost is decreasing. The panel also clarified that the moderate quality",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        296.1374816894531,
        399.1228332519531,
        309.62750244140625
      ],
      "text": "evidence relates to comparisons of the duration of the two antibiotic regimens of",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        309.1374816894531,
        399.0826416015625,
        322.62750244140625
      ],
      "text": "amoxicillin for 3 versus 5 days which showed that they were no different in terms of",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        322.1374816894531,
        176.80288696289062,
        335.62750244140625
      ],
      "text": "cure and clinical failure rates.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        346.6560974121094,
        231.48292541503906,
        358.6460876464844
      ],
      "text": "6.2.1\t Evidence and summary of findings",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Bold",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        362.3106994628906,
        399.122802734375,
        375.80072021484375
      ],
      "text": "Randomized trials have not shown significant differences in the effectiveness of",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        384.2554016113281,
        375.0906982421875,
        399.055419921875,
        388.80072021484375
      ],
      "text": "see",
      "font": "MinionPro-Semibold",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        375.3106994628906,
        384.76287841796875,
        388.80072021484375
      ],
      "text": "different oral antibiotics for the treatment of non-severe pneumonia in children (",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        388.0906982421875,
        135.28289794921875,
        401.80072021484375
      ],
      "text": "GRADE table A7.9",
      "font": "MinionPro-Semibold",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        134.93310546875,
        388.3106994628906,
        399.10302734375,
        401.80072021484375
      ],
      "text": "). Amoxicillin and co-trimoxazole are the most widely available",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        401.3106994628906,
        399.1028747558594,
        414.80072021484375
      ],
      "text": "antibiotics. Amoxicillin has been shown to be more effective than co-trimoxazole",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        414.3106994628906,
        399.1129455566406,
        427.80072021484375
      ],
      "text": "for treating severe pneumonia in one trial. There is no significant difference between",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        427.3106689453125,
        399.02288818359375,
        440.8006896972656
      ],
      "text": "short duration (3 day) and long duration (5 day) antibiotic therapy for non-severe",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        440.3106689453125,
        232.51292419433594,
        453.8006896972656
      ],
      "text": "pneumonia in low HIV prevalence settings.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        453.3106689453125,
        399.08148193359375,
        466.8006896972656
      ],
      "text": "A systematic review [Sajwani, 2010] identified trials comparing different oral",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        466.3106689453125,
        382.2928466796875,
        479.8006896972656
      ],
      "text": "antibiotics and short-course (3 days) versus long-course (5 days) oral antibiotics.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        487.8047180175781,
        133.16290283203125,
        499.9447021484375
      ],
      "text": "Choice of antibiotic",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Obli",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        500.814697265625,
        399.05279541015625,
        514.3046875
      ],
      "text": "Three studies compared oral co-trimoxazole with oral amoxicillin. The studies",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        513.814697265625,
        399.0628662109375,
        527.3046875
      ],
      "text": "involved 3952 children (2067 in the co-trimoxazole group and 1885 in the amoxicillin",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        526.814697265625,
        399.1130065917969,
        540.3046875
      ],
      "text": "group) between 2 months and 59 months of age with WHO-defined non-severe",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        539.814697265625,
        399.1127014160156,
        553.3046875
      ],
      "text": "pneumonia. One study [Strauss, 1998] also included a subset of children with",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        552.814697265625,
        399.0627136230469,
        566.3046875
      ],
      "text": "severe pneumonia. Two studies were double blinded RCTs, with adequate allocation",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        565.8145751953125,
        399.06298828125,
        579.3045654296875
      ],
      "text": "concealment. The third study was an open-label and cluster-randomized. Primary",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        578.8145751953125,
        399.1128845214844,
        592.3045654296875
      ],
      "text": "outcomes were clinical cure and failure. Comparing amoxicillin to co-trimoxazole,",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        591.8145751953125,
        399.0225830078125,
        605.3045654296875
      ],
      "text": "pooled analysis shows no difference in clinical failure (RR 1.09, 95% CI 0.93 to 1.27; 3",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        604.8145751953125,
        308.0428466796875,
        618.3045654296875
      ],
      "text": "studies) nor cure rate (RR 0.99, 95% CI 0.96 to 1.01; 2 studies).",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        222.3686981201172,
        644.9403076171875,
        230.6757049560547,
        655.2992553710938
      ],
      "text": "40",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Ligh",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    }
  ]
}